{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_synopsis", "source_sha256": "374e54cc9a49378cb4ae4db02bee3bbb4c2fe7c2914f303012abe77130c8e5ca", "ja": "センター公演が決まりレッスンに張り切る\n響は、ハードワークが過ぎて倒れてしまう。\n反省しつつも、センターに立つ以上は劇場で\n1番のアイドルでありたいと願う響は、倒れ\nない程度に全力を尽くすと誓うのだった。", "zh": "敲定Center公演之后，响一直埋头苦练，\n但她却因为过劳而倒下了。\n在反省的同时，她觉得自己既然是Center，\n那就必须要成为剧场第一的偶像，\n誓言自己会在不影响身体的范围内全力以赴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ecaef6e5b075bccad1d3ed1bf77d08747b37bca193bbc72f1cdbcfc260d18e5e", "ja": "（響のセンター公演の告知は、反響がすごかった。\nファンの人達の期待に、しっかり応えないとな）", "zh": "（响的Center公演预告公开后，得到了绝大的回响。\n这下得好好回应粉丝们的期待才行呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ced5f606f016d4a2d89bf4475e0849b523dc6ca04ed8c4d66105ba635f1afe5e", "ja": "そういえば、昼がまだだったな……\n遅くなったけど、休憩がてら何か食べて……。", "zh": "说起来，我还没吃午餐呢……\n虽然有点晚了，就趁休息时吃点什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1002_se", "source_sha256": "859b95c58099c5bec5dab51691bbacae12c257957c4e5bf67b74f3403af0436b", "ja": "ドタドタドタ……バタンッ！", "zh": "哒哒哒……砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "2869c981752a3f9861fe7db064359034a08836be27a919ed83cf8959176fe9d9", "ja": "{$P$}！　た、大変です！\n響が、響が～っ！", "zh": "{$P$}！糟、糟糕了！\n响她、响她～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "d8acfe6893dc447976136fed70f290c6f6ae66559b2071824a921413c551d619", "ja": "ひびき、たまきたちが何を言っても聞いてくれないの！\nおやぶん、助けて……！", "zh": "不管环我们说什么，响都听不进去！\n老大，快帮帮忙……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1005_p", "source_sha256": "497eea8d13ef8ae9b20346e7f2b3d06de4d8f84f31f5d13b329453d592b38074", "ja": "ふたりとも、そんなに慌ててどうしたんだ？\n響がどうしたって？", "zh": "你们两个这么慌张是怎么了？\n响发生了什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "520bd72032069587823b1217f24a944556e5997ab33f9b2939bc5f446e017c9a", "ja": "のんびりしてる場合じゃないぞ、おやぶん！\n早くしないと、みんなやられちゃうぞ！", "zh": "现在没有时间了啦，老大！\n再不快点行动，大家都会被打败的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "c92edde89f2822cbedf865c02c9d55ef47a854613ffaead6c7b55edc42f28ead", "ja": "とにかく一緒に来てください！　響を止められるのは、\nもう{$P$}しかいないんです！", "zh": "总之你快跟我们来！能阻止响的人，\n就只剩下{$P$}了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1008_p", "source_sha256": "f2dd1ae830c3706c1ad6db27b4aee281f9f89185fb930c79ca8b1e3410540f66", "ja": "わ、わかった！\nとりあえず、響の所へ行こう！", "zh": "我、我知道了！\n总之先去找响吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "3a1502e619eac8e0f2a4bfb01a8eaba393d33e74dd1e66034e98f784acc96bd0", "ja": "ぜぇ……ぜぇ……ぜぇ……ぜぇ……。", "zh": "呼……呼……呼……呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "9455b126f63cc87bc40073a758c4d1e3c1cf28e8f6c7c8916a7932517a311a2d", "ja": "響、もうやめようよ～！\nこれ以上続けたら、倒れちゃうってば！", "zh": "响，快点停下来啦～！\n你再继续下去，身体会吃不消的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "f71d48a499105f1f30de7797a62e6d796c6ca749f9f9e11867d77f13efd29579", "ja": "じ……自分は、これくらい、へっちゃらだぞっ。\nほら、もう1本いこう！", "zh": "对本……对本人来说，这点程度根本不算什么！\n好了，再来一次！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1012_p", "source_sha256": "ae2bdb7bf0ce73bf425a906754192f0f68e0fe8a293809b4c145e7f106177b81", "ja": "響！　どうしたんだ、みんなも……\nヘトヘトじゃないか。一体、何があったんだ？", "zh": "响！发生什么事了？大家也在……\n每个人都精疲力尽了不是吗？到底是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2b93e9bcdd875745d18832901c601eccf157152ca8820e87a9c15f463242bc1c", "ja": "あ、来てくれたんだ！？\n{$P$}からも言ってやってよ～！", "zh": "啊，你来了啊！？\n{$P$}也快点帮忙劝劝她啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "5edabca4571ce0855ed40f843d819daa3ba62db6885efa6fdf0eb7fbd2cc1ae4", "ja": "響ってば、さっきからヘロヘロなのに\nまだまだやれるって聞かないんだよーっ！", "zh": "响吼，身体明明已经累得不得了，\n但她却坚持自己还行，根本不听劝啊──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "fafb76872b6623fd4eddcc592ca0bab9817a9e3a8dabb5964a3dafdc6cd7f3e3", "ja": "朝から、ずーーーー……っと、レッスンしてるのに！\nこんなんじゃ、ケガしちゃうよ！", "zh": "从早上开始，就一～～～～直在练习！\n再这样下去会受伤的啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1016_p", "source_sha256": "bd79a74660e04d0223f6b3e25672f6718bb6a06eacb7132586f42a7fd56d72e6", "ja": "朝からずっと？\n響、さすがにやりすぎだ！", "zh": "从早上练到现在？\n响，你这样是真的过头了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1017_013hib", "source_sha256": "ff6e0d518c1f448322650c58080eafe72c6fb0eb8c72cd0ed7968d33c3439afd", "ja": "{$P$}……。\n自分、もっとカンペキになりたいんだ……。", "zh": "{$P$}……\n本人想要变得更完美……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1018_013hib", "source_sha256": "0e17a3a14b013ba9a1b924d7c62427fe96b8dad4af571b5ad2a7810620bfeb23", "ja": "だから、今はとことん頑張らなきゃ。\n休んでるヒマなんかないぞ！", "zh": "所以，现在得拚命努力才行。\n本人可没空休息啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1019_p", "source_sha256": "71ba76fd657298e611c0feb94ca1f9980a06d2f43db64c409328aca06da4d760", "ja": "響……。", "zh": "响……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1020_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ada86df93dd4d9be11194b4a17a0f434e59209f16ea699f047217f04cf0febef", "ja": "こうなったら……響、アタシとダンス勝負だ！\nアタシが勝ったら、大人しく休憩してもらうよ！", "zh": "既然这样……响，跟我来场跳舞对决吧！\n我要是赢了，你就给我乖乖去休息！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1021_013hib", "source_sha256": "19a75a6effa6330d4480b4d4b07a2cd8599565fb02f37a619f0ceb3bed3e88ec", "ja": "うん……っ、望むところさー！\n自分はどんな勝負だって、受けて立つぞ！", "zh": "嗯……！求之不得啦──！\n不论遇上什么挑战，本人都接受喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1022_006mak", "source_sha256": "178ddf2d8890071ea16f37dae22cbdded33e6b2d1e543b0b7d8376240dd06397", "ja": "ダメだよ、歩！　今勝負なんてしたら、\nふたりともケガしちゃうよ！", "zh": "不行啦，步！现在比舞的话，\n你们两个都会受伤的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1023_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5735c34d632c754131df7b67f64355dfbf25799a8a9457ab30e0a3b1e26468a4", "ja": "そ、それもそうか！\nでも、それじゃどうやって引き止めれば……。", "zh": "说、说得也是！\n可是，这样到底该用什么方法阻止她才好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1024_040tam", "source_sha256": "7c7477b7cc521a188f2bcae14246b22f38d13609fe50acb0847f3da8d89644a8", "ja": "虫取り勝負！　ひびき、たまきと虫取り勝負しよう！\n近くの公園で、多く取った方の勝ちだぞ！", "zh": "抓虫对决！响，跟环用抓虫来一较高下吧。\n到附近的公园，看谁抓的虫多谁就是赢家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1025_013hib", "source_sha256": "0f7698a3b03327e37f553c677c67fb59e0bd836e0bd592116c58c579243f0947", "ja": "自分も環と虫取りしたいけど……また今度ね。\n公演が終わったら、一緒に遊ぼう！", "zh": "本人也想跟环一起抓虫……但现在不是时候。\n等公演结束，我们再一起玩吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1026_040tam", "source_sha256": "bb0313481f65cf8205beb92a70a4230c050db6a66fc9d408316b122e6dc644e9", "ja": "ホント！？　じゃあ約束ね！\nくふふ……ひびきと遊ぶの楽しみ～♪", "zh": "真的吗！？那约好了喔！\n呵呵……好期待跟响一起玩～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1027_006mak", "source_sha256": "1b4c24e8e961eeb29ddd0c0881e38df94d1e737d773f99e1d9b021ec61e5ba23", "ja": "ああっ、話が終っちゃった！", "zh": "啊啊！阻止失败了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1028_p", "source_sha256": "5226c0b1e20bdbc937ef0a00fcb2742b39be7b591e881298fd3ab060111b9aab", "ja": "……響、みんなの言うとおり、いい加減休もう。\n朝からレッスンしてるなら、お昼も食べてないだろ？", "zh": "……响，大家说得对，你该休息了。\n如果是从早上练到现在，那你午餐也还没吃对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1029_013hib", "source_sha256": "c84bc40da9cc6c06a247fdb6081fa352c127ed20d6413b87fe692e44a121c488", "ja": "それは大丈夫だぞっ。\n自分、お腹空いてないから……。", "zh": "这个就不用担心喔！\n本人……并不觉得饿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1030_se", "source_sha256": "76932b6de2f7be7ae785651ba04807bd873a086d033fd3ae90c26d7609ebea8b", "ja": "グゥゥゥ………。", "zh": "咕噜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1031_013hib", "source_sha256": "b41e938ae268f76f0e67305f147371ab9f9b0161b5972d5cb57ee71286b82e4d", "ja": "はっ！？\nい、今のは、その……！", "zh": "啊！？\n刚、刚才那个是，呃……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1032_029umi", "source_sha256": "d35f8a0dc76cafc6b8b9eead25ba8c076178000ba0c13ffb77b6bf3166723a5e", "ja": "あ、私、お昼作ってくる！　新しい料理開発したんだ！\nその名も『女子力MAXゴーヤチャンプルー』！！", "zh": "啊，我去做午饭！我开发了新的料理！\n名字叫做『女子力MAX苦瓜炒什锦』！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1033_029umi", "source_sha256": "713d70b9aa2d068b01023a0ba21399339125569047c8337eceaee731176ece26", "ja": "美奈子先生に手伝ってもらったから、味は保証するよ！\nすっごく美味しいから、食べて食べて☆", "zh": "我有请美奈子老师帮忙，味道是挂保证的！\n真的非常好吃，大家一定要吃吃看☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1034_013hib", "source_sha256": "f647a5ba713752f8f1a1e5d7300bd506296cc8504597ea1fed3c1d85e2decbdb", "ja": "だ、大丈夫ったら、大丈夫！\nお腹が空いてたって、自分は踊れるし……！", "zh": "本、本人说不用就是不用！\n就算肚子再饿，本人也能继续跳舞……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1035_013hib", "source_sha256": "580c66c066ae2b93144faf74429168adccfa572277ff03e99ac21a7e24c3ac9a", "ja": "ほら！　こんなふうにターンだって……あ、あれ？", "zh": "你们看！像这样转圈也没……奇、奇怪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1036_013hib", "source_sha256": "8d26c71c5ca99abd87d4ca8d7c235c99320b0ca1f09d6bd66a6dfe4355d14409", "ja": "お、おかしいぞ……\n急に、目が回って…………ガクッ。", "zh": "不、不太对劲耶……\n突然、头晕目眩…………（倒地）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1037_p", "source_sha256": "f956e95860f9171550d6418f53a6ebb54b3f8cb5f82d59dead313adc990c53a2", "ja": "響！？", "zh": "響！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1038_034ayu", "source_sha256": "238072c66a3b66b92e076f01bf1fb8f11c8766d701cfc9853d17d82429dbabf4", "ja": "うわぁ、響が倒れた！？\nきゅ、救急車！　誰か救急車呼んでー！", "zh": "唔哇！响倒下了！？\n救、救护车！快来人叫救护车啊──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1039_040tam", "source_sha256": "fc07e13128173db3bbdfbc51be628e0ac2e597cbd16d383f448b3a485ee32257", "ja": "ひっ……、ひびき～！！\nひびき、ひびきってば～！！", "zh": "响……响～！！\n响、响啊～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1040_p", "source_sha256": "3dd554b9648238850ddde1f24f758e282d4d5a4ad9222387f3388862770b2604", "ja": "ふたりとも落ちつくんだ！　みんなも、\nこういう時こそ、落ち着いて行動しよう！", "zh": "你们两个都冷静点！\n大家也是，这种时候更要沉着应对！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1041_006mak", "source_sha256": "63a363628a2151f1a4037388abe1b88b8274f122840deb09422c627c1644b622", "ja": "そ、そうですよね。えっと……海美、タオルを濡らして\nきて！　歩と環は、スポーツドリンクをお願い！", "zh": "说、说得也是。那个……海美你去准备湿毛巾！\n步和环去负责运动饮料！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1042_029umi", "source_sha256": "75e058d32c586d9502a3569c1bbe9d9d55ee49e0ec23cdc7b42695922524144e", "ja": "わ、わかった！　行ってくる！", "zh": "明、明白了！我马上回来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1043_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1044_013hib", "source_sha256": "05e1388d442d367135e9607f3d1fb884eac6ca871508b360a51f1b8f09a0ff14", "ja": "ふー、お腹いっぱいだぞ。女子力ゴーヤチャンプルー、\n自分もレパートリーに入れてみようかな？", "zh": "呼～吃得好饱喔，本人是不是\n也该把女子力苦瓜炒什锦学起来当拿手菜啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1045_p", "source_sha256": "57488536c3b9b8404e1086fb7b84ae10ee712d950354d1889b8b42283655c6af", "ja": "ああ、見た目が蛍光ピンク色ですごかったけど、\n確かに美味かったな。", "zh": "是啊，虽然萤光粉红色的外观很吓人，\n但确实很好吃呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1046_p", "source_sha256": "2960afa268a5b6fc7842f50cfa76d1e5f637595ce2b0f15ff504fad042d59cde", "ja": "ところで響、もう体の方は大丈夫か？", "zh": "是说响，你的身体已经不要紧了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1047_013hib", "source_sha256": "e1e1248fc79e7ecb22be483fd771420169d799702e3e50dea03037393c964ecc", "ja": "うんっ。\nいっぱい寝ちゃったし、もう元気になったぞ！", "zh": "嗯！\n好好睡了一觉后已经完全恢复了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1048_013hib", "source_sha256": "2845c759db1554bc716bb034b71e8900993bb8f73980dc6f4fdc1d9006ff88e9", "ja": "そういえば、みんなは？\nみんなにも、もう大丈夫だよって教えてあげないと。", "zh": "说到这个，大家呢？\n本人也得跟大家报一下平安才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1049_p", "source_sha256": "d130289532c8a8728eae228d4912671146056a39764555efac411294efc75d82", "ja": "先に帰ってもらったんだ。響が起きるまで待つって\n聞かなかったけど、遅くなってきたから。", "zh": "我先请她们回去了，虽然她们坚持\n要等响醒来，但时候也不早了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1050_013hib", "source_sha256": "9efd7d2c3f2e32072f3b255fd98cc9b33bec8a8bcb77c039e1aafefde5f3a51d", "ja": "そっか……。\nなら、みんなにメッセージ送っておくね。", "zh": "这样啊……\n那本人传讯息跟大家说一声。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1051_p", "source_sha256": "2f3171bfdc7257aa2d2f8a2bfc18d8559de55c71dc64fcc5bf97502fbf3fb753", "ja": "そうだな。\nそれじゃ、響も帰ろうか。途中まで送るよ。", "zh": "是啊。\n那么，响也回家吧，我送你出去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1052_013hib", "source_sha256": "13a34e9ada91e0e6bd2fc76c5363656722d29711b01c910240789a0ddc578691", "ja": "えっ。じ、自分ならもう平気だぞっ。それに、\n{$P$}だって……忙しいんでしょ？", "zh": "咦？本、本人已经没事了啦！\n而且，{$P$}自己……也很忙吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1053_p", "source_sha256": "c74da503985e70ce5387f69894c9312f1a6dcde312f786d1263a5601156bcfb2", "ja": "今さら遠慮しなくていいよ。\nほら、いいから行こう。", "zh": "事到如今还跟我客气什么。\n好了，我们快走吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1054_013hib", "source_sha256": "2155b2cd4a7264fa717188554dc286dc2331d6d40ddc13d2ba14bf90d459642e", "ja": "あ。う、うん……。", "zh": "啊，呃、嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1055_013hib", "source_sha256": "7a8c01c504693cf71087109ebbb32908e7abb667c592ecc32e6a62e9f0ccd676", "ja": "あ、みて、{$P$}！\n星がすっごくキレイさ～。", "zh": "啊，你看，{$P$}！\n星星超级美的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1056_p", "source_sha256": "45804c91933e6aa12a1a6c2b128d93ece85e0f0276bf041a0b6e56054b0c6caa", "ja": "本当だ。\nこんなにキレイに見えるなんて珍しいな。", "zh": "真的耶，能看得这么清楚真是难得啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1057_013hib", "source_sha256": "fb760a491a4ed03f008e3310d0dadf7b25385776e176fd80b396d7143e3b3ffb", "ja": "なんだか今日は、いつもよりキレイに見えるよね！\nちょっと、沖縄の空に似てる……。", "zh": "今天的星空，好像比平时都还要清晰呢！\n感觉跟冲绳的星空有点像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1058_013hib", "source_sha256": "e16d9e09d186248067136ec6a7705c7405694132c5d804f30c325b5c090f6a00", "ja": "島のみんな、元気かな。……えへへ、見ててね！\n自分、絶対にトップアイドルになるからーっ！", "zh": "不晓得岛上的大家过得好不好……嘿嘿，大家看着！\n本人一定会成为顶尖偶像的──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1060_013hib", "source_sha256": "074b3452e8fa61b3dd16c4eac2ef48e7fc4a01723c498d2f6ba2933685617a53", "ja": "よーし！　{$P$}、自分、ホントに\nもう元気だから安心してね！　明日もまた頑張るぞ～！", "zh": "好──！{$P$}，本人是真的\n已经没事了，你放心吧！明天也要继续努力喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1061_p", "source_sha256": "96b29326b071888c5b458dd50ee1457ee3ca5f1063c2e82cf5c3158d4c620fc3", "ja": "それは頼もしくて何よりだ。……でも、\nまたみんなに心配かけないようにな？", "zh": "这么可靠真是太好了……\n不过，你可别再让大家操心了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1062_013hib", "source_sha256": "82ba606248e7b8ed7c3c0eaca5c95ddcb8a212c62afb3c68c6c427c58e45e244", "ja": "う、うん、わかってる。今日はちょっと\nやりすぎたぞ……。あの、ゴメンなさい。", "zh": "好、好的，本人知道了。\n今天是真的有点做过头了……那个，对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1063_013hib", "source_sha256": "69655e70b2498933f70d125efa3b380d8b8291538fef58f852975b2f1a777815", "ja": "でもね、{$P$}。今日みんなと一緒に\nレッスンして……自分、わかっちゃったんだ。", "zh": "不过呢，{$P$}，今天和大家\n一起练习后……本人发现了一件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1064_013hib", "source_sha256": "ee052d7c05427053f1395c9f5495a9fc40ba30b2ef52e5e1424bff18155bd4dd", "ja": "自分はまだ、ぜんぜん1番じゃないって！", "zh": "那就是，自己还完全算不上是第一！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1065_p", "source_sha256": "046c3e1276d49430d60656d5ba80936644c364055c7c83418306cad10e055861", "ja": "1番じゃない……？", "zh": "算不上是第一……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1066_013hib", "source_sha256": "0f8bb0eb74ba7c30b21bc4cb6920f164c8d47d540de4b749b2e7a3ceba09f112", "ja": "そうだぞっ。真はもともとすごかったけど、\n歩も海美も環も、すっごくよくなってるよね？", "zh": "没错喔！真本来就很厉害，\n但步、海美还有环也变得越来越厉害了不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1067_013hib", "source_sha256": "00432b9e151a3debc607f1c3a0ce3cbd1bee65a897c111275e9ffd25a4fbc8f9", "ja": "ダンスだけじゃなくて、歌も表現も、なんかこう……\n伸びやかで、キラキラしてる感じでさ！", "zh": "不只是跳舞，唱歌跟表现手法都……该怎么形容呢……\n给人一种悠扬又闪耀的感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1068_p", "source_sha256": "4482b4e195e2d926850f36c7b9dd55170ab4ad84a86dc4df2ff0d2af5ba19ecd", "ja": "そうだな。3人ともステージに慣れてきたし、\n伸び盛りだから。", "zh": "是啊，她们三个都已经习惯表演了，\n进步得飞快呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1069_013hib", "source_sha256": "7a15984576b6471ff4b514e5e143d0edaf6c3175b93046bc398dc9eacf82051c", "ja": "でしょでしょ？　だから自分、いくらレッスンしても\nやめられなかったんだ。だって……。", "zh": "对吧对吧？所以本人……才会觉得要\n一直练才行，因为……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1070_013hib", "source_sha256": "1d1d7c4c89652bcadf22634f5d94e2461e37b5ee11973b5374e8c58e6f670d83", "ja": "劇場のセンターに立つのは、劇場で1番のアイドル。\n自分はそう思ってるから！", "zh": "只有剧场第一名的偶像才能担任剧场的Center……\n本人是这么认为的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1071_p", "source_sha256": "9ad0df46076ad35e5d22daa853b696b6fd4ada0f0315dcbcb508b6996be8b72f", "ja": "劇場で1番のアイドル、か。\n……簡単になれるものじゃないぞ？", "zh": "剧场第一名的偶像啊……\n这个头衔可没那么容易取得喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1072_013hib", "source_sha256": "3b18cd0f38dd73704aaef6644876ddb674c6993225fd3f42cf33d554da8037d7", "ja": "そ、そんなのわかってるぞ。春香たちも、\n劇場のみんなも、もう十分すごいし……。", "zh": "这、这本人知道啦，春香她们，\n还有剧场的大家都已经厉害到不行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1073_013hib", "source_sha256": "f9852441a7970f4b3630a8e5098510635e7f6d16513badbfca854433fc477a1c", "ja": "でも自分が目指してるのは、トップアイドルなんだ。\n仲間にも誰にも負けない、1番のアイドルだからね！", "zh": "但本人的目标是成为顶尖偶像，\n成为不输给伙伴、不输给任何人的第一名偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1074_013hib", "source_sha256": "0a48efdf837d2b7d7d223f76eefb04f4d3112edede634f49d3e84f9731d718d9", "ja": "そうなるために、自分は誰よりも頑張らなくちゃ。\nでないと、胸をはってセンターに立てないぞっ！", "zh": "为了这个目标，本人得比别人都更努力才行。\n否则本人便无法名正言顺地担任Center啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1075_p", "source_sha256": "7ff3a21c70875de0d3a03ebbde1945d08098014f0f6939edf62f1b38bb095436", "ja": "そうか……。\nつまり、今は負けを認めるんだな？", "zh": "原来是这样……\n也就是说，你现在自认比不上大家对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1076_013hib", "source_sha256": "938b858493731e6830952d1e7f2d0bd23e32b227f14f56906d875f059575a7bc", "ja": "えええっ！？　な、なんでそういう言い方するの！？\nヒドイぞ、{$P$}！！", "zh": "咦咦咦！？为、为什么要这样说！？\n太过分了，{$P$}！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1077_p", "source_sha256": "c9fc83dddf49865a3ab9fdb2d5e7d76484258bfa5b472fcd6e54cf690697b27f", "ja": "いやいや、勝つためにはまず今の負けを認めないと。\n認められないから、頑張りすぎるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "不不不，为了取胜，首先你要先认输才行。\n就是因为你不服气，所以才会操坏身体不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1078_013hib", "source_sha256": "53eec05c3f55650a2add867bc21fd8c37a13db800ece0e679921c635afc6c615", "ja": "うっ！　そ、そういわれると……\nそう、かも……？", "zh": "唔！听、听你这么一说……\n好像、没错……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1079_p", "source_sha256": "36e691c8257bff3228a246f9707de4be14aa40a29f17ab29943795eacca1a8d8", "ja": "だから冷静に自分を見つめて、\n着実にレッスンを続けていけるようにしよう。", "zh": "所以你要冷静下来检视自己，\n脚踏实地做好每一次的练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1080_p", "source_sha256": "df8624c394ca38ec6b6175c657035c69bdef6d941b7f92327474a738eaac7ab5", "ja": "ペースを守って、続けられるように休憩も取って。\nそしたら最終的に、劇場で1番頑張れるだろ？", "zh": "保持练习的步调，同时也要休息让自己得以继续。\n这样才能成为剧场里最努力的人没错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1081_013hib", "source_sha256": "83d8ed53ba8e11d1909065e07ff624c0511684100cc0ecab40a30ae6d4f24934", "ja": "あ。……うんっ、それならいいぞ！\n自分、約束する！　ちゃんと休憩も取るって！", "zh": "啊……没错！那样的话没问题！\n本人答应你！本人会乖乖休息的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1082_013hib", "source_sha256": "8ce6087783fe5413d021e7a0f6f7b9f00ffcc4e6cd7db5e6861bb4c073ab0c6f", "ja": "それに、また倒れたら心配かけちゃうし……。\n劇場で1番のアイドルが、それじゃダメだよね。", "zh": "而且要是又倒下的话也会让大家操心……\n想成为剧场第一的偶像，这样是不行的对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1083_p", "source_sha256": "8a583bd64e5b50de8cc7f48d41b453d75cd84c7665d90e3f43872ad83bfab5ab", "ja": "ああ、1番のアイドルがフラフラしてたら、\nファンにも心配かけそうだしな。", "zh": "是啊，第一名的偶像要是连路都走不好，\n那粉丝们应该也会很担心吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1084_013hib", "source_sha256": "6766f4fa587914ad6bc146117ec92d0a38bf6ad46028d566b6fd2bb74543f679", "ja": "わかったぞ！　ちゃんとペースを守りながら、\n全力で頑張り続ける！　目指すは頂点さー！", "zh": "本人明白了！本人会按部就班，\n尽全力继续加油！目标是拿下第一啦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1085_p", "source_sha256": "9ebd6fc8942835ab905fc3170a62bbc54055b094186a8df70ec70268a9a0f1fb", "ja": "（高い目標に向かって一直線に。\nその目はいつだって、光り輝く未来だけを見ている）", "zh": "（朝宏大的目标笔直前进，\n眼里永远都只有那闪耀动人的未来。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_043_1086_p", "source_sha256": "a270088f6597b9f88c72d291c33ddb178e3d6de19cd18b1cb222d579e8a4bb2b", "ja": "（危なかっしいその背中を、しっかり見守って\nいこう。まだまだ、目が離せそうにないからな！）", "zh": "（我要好好守护那叫人担心的背影。\n看来她现在还是需要有人顾着才行呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
